{"title":"Carrion Vulture","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 30 Vulture that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/vulture-eye\">Vulture Eye</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-232.2px,-581.4px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/1/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/1/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:512px\"><i style=\"left:189.1px;top:562.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:189.8px;top:564.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:173.3px;top:562.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:222.8px;top:591.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:245.4px;top:581.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:248.9px;top:579.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:269.5px;top:571.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:253.7px;top:599.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:319.7px;top:598.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:316.3px;top:599.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:327.9px;top:618.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:295.6px;top:634.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:319.7px;top:628.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:327.3px;top:640.4px\"></i></div><figcaption>Scorpion Pits</figcaption></fig